    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Aspen Desktop Continuity Verification L4, you are with the group when clattering hooves, surprised yelps, and frantic bleating cut through the afternoon.\n\nA fluffy white sheep with a black face and curled horns bounds toward you. An ornate scroll is held in its mouth, and as it approaches, the sheep waves the scroll toward the group.\n\nThe commotion is close now: the sheep, its scroll, and the people reacting around you. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 514,
      "citations": [
