    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You read the ornate scroll aloud. As the words leave your mouth, the sheep’s frantic bleating shifts into cultured, elven-accented Common—clear enough for you to understand.\n\n“I am Finethir Shinebright, a wizard in dire need of aid!” he begins. “You must help me recover a powerful artifact from a dangerous, possibly insane wizard—”\n\nApproaching howls cut him off before he can explain further. The sheep still has the scroll, and his urgent request hangs unfinished amid the clattering hooves and startled yelps. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 517,
      "citations": [
        {
