    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Finethir, where can I find Noke and the wand, and how do I get there?",
      "event_id": 520,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:33:07.900199Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "The sheep’s cultured voice answers promptly. “Noke lives in my old home, southeast of town, and he keeps the wand on his person. I know that house intimately; I can guide you through it.”\n\nFinethir explains the way: “Follow the road from town for a few miles, then take the well-trodden path through the sparse woodland. It’s about another mile from there.” The ornate scroll remains in his mouth, and the howls that interrupted him still carry from nearby. What do you say or do?",
      "event_id": 520,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
          "audience": "player",
