    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You remain beside Finethir in plain view as the commotion closes in. A hulking half-orc pushes through the crowd, one hand on a greatsword. Three large wolves with iron collars accompany him, while the heavy footfalls of a huge cloaked figure sound behind them.\n\nThe half-orc fixes his small eyes on the sheep. “That sheep is Master Noke’s... he desires to have it back.” Finethir stands beside you with the ornate scroll in his mouth as the pursuers draw near. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 523,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 2,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
