    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I stop hiding. I hand Finethir over to Guz and stand aside, then openly walk beside them as they leave. I ask Guz to take me to Noke.",
      "event_id": 526,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:35:31.847847Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You step out of hiding, hand Finethir over to Guz, and stand aside. The half-orc takes the sheep into his group; Finethir remains with them, his ornate scroll still in reach. You fall in beside them and ask Guz to take you to Noke.\n\nGuz gives you a wary look, then turns with his group toward Noke. The commotion around you subsides as they set off, with Finethir among them. You have made your intentions plain, and the group is headed toward the wizard—but you have not yet reached him.\n\nThe sheep keeps close to the group, looking from one person to another with an unmistakably expectant air. What do you do as you set out with them?",
      "event_id": 526,
