    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You call out in plain view, asking Noke to answer you about Finethir and the wand. Your words carry along the narrow, well-trodden track beneath the tall oaks. No reply comes from the quiet woodland, and Noke’s home is still out of sight; you can see only the path winding onward through the trees.\n\nYou can continue along the track toward the home, or call out again.",
